      "username": "guilherme",
      "name": "Guilherme de Paula",
      "created_at": "2024-03-08T20:42:37.041Z",
      "cooked": "<p>I disabled it by using this client script in the parent doctype:</p>\n<pre><code class=\"lang-auto\">function disable_drag_drop(frm) {\n   frm.page.body.find('[data-fieldname=\"items\"] [data-idx] .data-row .sortable-handle').removeClass('sortable-handle'); // change 'items' to the child table field name\n}\n\nfrappe.ui.form.on('Delivery Note', {\n\trefresh(frm) {\n\t\tdisable_drag_drop(frm);\n\t},\n\tonload(frm){\n\t    disable_drag_drop(frm);\n\t}\n})\n</code></pre>",
      "avatar_template": "/user_avatar/discuss.frappe.io/guilherme/{size}/65298_2.png",
