      "id": 487300,
      "username": "firmanarihere",
      "name": "firman",
      "created_at": "2025-11-24T03:51:01.854Z",
      "cooked": "<p>I made some alternative</p>\n<blockquote>\n<pre><code class=\"lang-auto\">function disable_drag_drop(frm, fieldname) {\n\tconst grid = frm.get_field(fieldname).grid;\n\tif (!grid) return;\n\n\t$(grid.wrapper)\n\t\t.find(\".sortable-handle\")\n\t\t.removeClass(\"sortable-handle\")\n}\nfrappe.ui.form.on('Delivery Note', {\n\tonload(frm){\n\t    disable_drag_drop(frm, \"child_table_fieldname\");\n\t}\n})\n</code></pre>\n</blockquote>",
